{"id":"vod_sn_38632","vodId":"38632","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"食梦者第一季","name_cn":"食梦者第一季","date":"2010-01-01","year":"2010","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/fa44ed57fd542db637c6e98e2a4d65d4.jpg"},"summary":"真城最高（阿部敦 配音）是一个在绘画方面极有天赋的少年，年纪虽小却已经获得了大臣的认可和赏识。可是，从事漫画行业的叔叔之死让他放弃了创作漫画的梦想，封闭起心灵，过起了得过且过的放浪生活，直到好友高木秋人（日野聪 配音）出现在了他的面前。　　秋人的梦想是成为一名漫画家，可是，在文学创作上独树一帜他却对漫画一窍不通，在得知了高城的过去后，他向高城发出了邀请：“我写剧本，你创作，让我们成为漫画家吧！”虽然高城心里有千百个不情愿，无奈自己暗恋同班同学亚豆美保（早见沙织 配音）的把柄抓在秋人手上，就这样，两人踏上了成为漫画家的修罗之路，而高城对漫画的热爱也慢慢的被重新点燃了。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:03:15","playable":true,"episodeCount":25,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/fkSb7UnJcU1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/CNYP0RLgjv1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/0hEHGRw4yy1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/fiUXEDcwUY1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/NYHQ5xyCZQ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/SGrExyZz9B1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Q3FMaR9tLC1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/rNaSE2y5AA1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/PTybreNNp31/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/YcKxVQ56Qp1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/KkJsgJrBBZ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/2uArukrU1A1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/1DndVc3Tpi1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/XmQ28dZrDQ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15